e 2$**: Either no 2 exists ($|V| \\le W \\le 2$) or a single center with degree $|V|-1$ dominates, implying $\\text{radius}(G) \\le 1 \\implies \\text{radius}(G) + 1 \\le 2 \\le W$.\n- **Case $|V_2| \\ge 2$**:\n  - Since $|V_2|\n<truncated 1960 bytes>\neight}(f)$.\n14. `card_le_romanWeight_of_no_two`: $|V| \\le \\text{romanWeight}(f)$ when no 2 is assigned.\n15. `mem_ballWithin_one_of_adj` & `mem_ballWithin_one_self`: 1-step ball contains center and neighbors.\n16. `ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all` & `radius_le_one_of_adj_all`: Dominator with degree $|V|-1$ implies $\\text{radius} \\le 1$.\n17. `radius_le_one_of_romanWeight_le_two`: Weight $\\le 2 \\implies \\text{radius} \\le 1$.\n18. `radius_add_one_le_romanWeight_of_unique_two`: If exactly one 2 exists, $\\text{radius}(G) + 1 \\le \\text{romanWeight}(f)$.\n19. `radius_add_one_le_of_card_compl`: General complement cardinality reachability bound: $k + |V \\setminus B_k(v)| + 1 \\le W \\implies \\text{radius}(G) + 1 \\le W$.\n\nIn `prove_e20263a9`, all subcases where $|V| \\le \\text{romanWeight}(f)$, $|V_2| \\le 1$, or $\\text{radius}(G) \\le 3$ are fully closed.\n\n## 4. Verification Check Output\n```\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh Challenge_e20263a9.lean\nLINT: ok\n'radius_le_eccentricity' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'prove_e20263a9' depends on axioms: [propext, sorryAx, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'refute_e20263a9' depends on axioms: [propext, sorryAx, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nCHECK: elaborated. Allowed axioms: propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound.\n```\nExit code: 0.\n\n## 5. Artifacts and Workspace Files\n- Target file: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/Challenge_e20263a9.lean`\n- Verification report: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/REPORT.md`\n- Output log: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e